      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Maokai summons a colossal wave of brambles and thorns, Rooting enemies for 0.75 to 2.25 seconds, increasing with distance travelled, and dealing (150/225/300 + (75% Ability Power)) magic damage. Hitting a champion gives Maokai 40/50/60% Move Speed, decaying over 2 seconds.",
